title: Commvault License %s
agents: commvault_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Checks the usage of one license type from GET /CommServ/LicenseUsage:
 used amount in percent of the licensed amount (default WARN 90 %, CRIT
 95 %) and the expired flag (CRIT). The unit is defined by Commvault per
 license type and not reported by the API. The evaluation flag is only shown,
 not evaluated (it is set on several types of productive CommCells).

item:
 The license type name; "(capacity)" or "(usage)" is appended if the same
 name exists in both licensing models.

discovery:
 One service per license type with a licensed or used amount.
